# Gym Attendance & Access Control System — Production-Ready Implementation Plan (v2)

> Goal: Upgrade the prototype-grade attendance feature into a secure, role-aware, multi-tenant access control platform for gyms. Scope now includes Attendance, Self Check-In, Trainer oversight, Member history, and foundational hooks for Equipment Reservations, Class Booking, PT Sessions, Billing access, and Notifications.

---

## 🔴 Critical Issues (Blockers)

These must be fixed before any UI polish — they corrupt live data or expose security risks.

| # | Issue | File | Impact |
|---|-------|------|--------|
| 1 | Fake simulation data mixed with real data | `AttendanceController.java` lines 134, 177, 214–217, 313–348 | KPIs show invented numbers, analytics unreliable |
| 2 | Check-in/check-out implemented in `DashboardController` (not Attendance) | `DashboardController.java` lines 63–87 | Split architecture; wrong URL contract used by frontend |
| 3 | No duplicate check-in prevention | `CheckInRepository.java` | Members can check in multiple times in a day |
| 4 | Attendance endpoints locked to OWNER/ADMIN only | `AttendanceController.java` class-level `@PreAuthorize` | Trainers/Members cannot access their own views |
| 5 | No gym-scoped queries (multi-tenant breach) | `CheckInRepository.java` | Data leaks across gyms; wrong analytics |
| 6 | No member portal attendance page | `/frontend/src/pages/member/` | Members can’t view history/streak |
| 7 | No trainer member-attendance page | `/frontend/src/pages/trainer/` | Trainers can’t track assigned members |
| 8 | Status values inconsistent and stringly-typed | `CheckIn.java` | Mixed strings ("check-in", "checked-out"); fragile logic |
| 9 | `CheckInStatus`/`CheckInMethod` enums exist but unused | `model/CheckInStatus.java`, `model/CheckInMethod.java` | Technical debt; type safety not enforced |
| 10 | Conflicting `gymId` mapping (Column + ManyToOne) | `CheckIn.java` | JPA conflict; integrity risk |
| 11 | No pagination on read endpoints | `AttendanceController.java` | Unbounded responses; perf/scaling issues |
| 12 | Incomplete RBAC across app | Multiple controllers per RBAC audit | Sensitive data/actions exposed without guards |
| 13 | No audit fields for check-ins | `CheckIn` table | No device/IP/operator traceability |

---

## 📊 Current Architecture Audit (Ground Truth)

### Database — `CheckIn` model
```
CHECK_INS table:
  ✅ checkInId, userId, gymId, checkInTime, checkOutTime, status
  ❌ MISSING: deviceInfo, ipAddress, operatorUserId
  ❌ MISSING: notes (admin notes)
  ⚠ Present but unused in entity: enums `CheckInStatus`, `CheckInMethod`
  ⚠ Mapping conflict: `@Column("gym_id")` and `@ManyToOne(joinColumn="gym_id")`
```

### Repository — `CheckInRepository`
```
✅ findActiveCheckIns()
✅ findTodayCheckIns(startOfDay)
✅ findCheckInsForDateRange(start, end)
✅ findByUserUserIdOrderByCheckInTimeDesc(userId)
❌ MISSING: findActiveCheckInByUserId(userId) — duplicate prevention
❌ MISSING: countByUserIdAndDate(userId, date)
❌ MISSING: findByGymIdAndCheckInTimeBetween(gymId, start, end, Pageable) — gym-scoped pagination
❌ MISSING: findByUserUserIdAndCheckInTimeBetween(userId, start, end) — member history
```

### Service Layer
```
❌ MISSING: AttendanceService.java — logic is in controller (anti-pattern)
❌ MISSING: Streak calculation, attendance validation, gym scoping
```

### Controller — `AttendanceController`
```
✅ GET /api/attendance/today
✅ GET /api/attendance/live
✅ GET /api/attendance/trends
✅ GET /api/attendance/heatmap
✅ GET /api/attendance/stats
❌ MISSING: POST /api/attendance/check-in
❌ MISSING: PUT  /api/attendance/check-out/{id}
❌ MISSING: POST /api/attendance/me/check-in (MEMBER)
❌ MISSING: GET  /api/attendance/me/history (MEMBER)
❌ MISSING: GET  /api/attendance/trainer/members (TRAINER)
🔴 All above locked to OWNER/ADMIN via class-level `@PreAuthorize`
🔴 Simulation fallbacks corrupt analytics
```

### Frontend Service — `attendanceTaskApi.ts`
```
✅ Stats, trends, heatmap, today, live endpoints
⚠ checkIn / checkOut call `/dashboard/*` instead of `/api/attendance/*`
❌ MISSING: selfCheckIn(), getMyHistory(), getMyStreak(), getTrainerMembersAttendance()
❌ MISSING: server-side pagination params
```

### Frontend Pages
```
✅ /attendance → Owner/Admin analytics dashboard
❌ /member/my-attendance → Member history & streak
❌ /trainer/member-attendance → Trainer’s assigned members
```

