## ✅ Design Decisions (Resolved)
- Self Check-In: Geo-fenced app check-in within gym geofence radius
- QR Scope (this phase): Defer QR; support MANUAL and SELF methods now
- Trainer Visibility: Assigned members only; no access to other trainers’ members
- Multi-Tenant Scoping: JWT `activeGymId` claim is authoritative for server-side filtering
- Unresolved (confirm later): Empty analytics behavior, Absence alerts delivery channel, Required audit fields taxonomy

---

## 🧭 UI/UX Blueprint & Role Permissions

### Owner/Admin — Attendance Command Center
- Filters: Date range, Role (All/Members/Trainers/Staff), Method (MANUAL/SELF/QR/CLASS), Status (Active/Checked-out)
- KPIs: Today/Week/Month check-ins, Live Now, Avg Session, Busiest Hour
- Live Floor Panel: Avatars, Name, Role, Check-in time, Minutes inside, Method; actions: View, Check-out
- Today Table (server paginated): Name, Role, Method, Device/IP, Check-in, Check-out, Duration, Status, Operator, Actions
- Trends & Heatmap: Real data only; busiest hour callout; retention card
- Manual Check-In/Out: Search member → confirm → audit operatorUserId + notes
- Export: CSV for current filters and date range
- Accuracy: Seconds-precision timestamps; tooltips with raw values; timezone-safe

### Trainer — My Members (Assigned Only)
- Members List: Avatar/Name, Last Visit (color-coded <3d, 3–7d, >7d), Visits this month, Current streak, Absent Alert
- Live Now: Assigned members currently inside
- Drill-down: 30-day calendar, Recent Visits, Frequency chart per member
- Privacy: No access to other trainers’ data; optional “My Attendance” if tracking staff presence

### Member — My Attendance
- Streak Banner: Current streak, Longest streak, Visits this month
- Monthly Calendar: Visited (green), future (gray), selectable day details
- Recent Visits: Date, Check-in, Check-out, Duration, Method
- Frequency Chart: Visits per week last 12 weeks
- Check In Now: Geo-fenced self check-in; disabled outside gym with guidance; show “You’re checked in since HH:MM” when active

### Accessibility & Responsiveness
- WCAG 2.2 AA: 44x44 touch targets, keyboard navigation, visible focus rings
- Mobile-first layouts; sticky Live Panel on desktop; skeleton loaders; virtualized tables for large data

### Security & Privacy UX
- Clear scoping indicator: “Gym: {activeGymName}”
- Role-badged avatars; controls hidden when not authorized
- Confirmations for manual check-in/out with audit disclosure

