## 🔌 Data & API Mapping (No Simulation)
- Owner
  - `GET /api/attendance/today?role&from&to&page&size`
  - `GET /api/attendance/live?role`
  - `GET /api/attendance/stats?role`
  - `GET /api/attendance/trends?from&to&role`
  - `GET /api/attendance/heatmap?weeks&role`
  - `POST /api/attendance/check-in`
  - `PUT /api/attendance/check-out/{id}`
- Trainer
  - `GET /api/attendance/trainer/members?from&to&page&size`
  - `GET /api/attendance/trainer/member/{memberId}/history?from&to` (optional enhancement)
- Member
  - `POST /api/attendance/me/check-in` (geo-fenced)
  - `GET /api/attendance/me/history?from&to`
  - `GET /api/attendance/me/streak`

