## 🧪 QA Scenarios
- Role scoping: Owner sees all; Trainer sees assigned only; Member sees self only
- Self check-in inside vs outside geofence (deny with guidance outside)
- Duplicate check-in prevention and user feedback
- Pagination boundaries and sort correctness
- Timezone and DST correctness; cross-midnight sessions
- Absence alert logic (>7 days) once enabled

