## ⚠️ Open Questions (Remaining)
1. Empty Analytics display preference: show 0s vs guided empty states only
2. Absence alerts channel: in-app only vs email/SMS; opt-out controls
3. Audit fields taxonomy for manual check-ins (e.g., reason codes)
